                "embed": "<div>\n    <blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">I’m not just dressed like a pickle... I AM A PICKLE. I’d like you all to meet.... Dr. Dill. <a href=\"https://t.co/DDolrk2JSE\">pic.twitter.com/DDolrk2JSE</a></p>&mdash; Miz Cracker (@miz_cracker) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/miz_cracker/status/987128554520330241?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 20, 2018</a></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"></script>\n\n</div>\n"
