            "type": "paragraph",
            "value": "<h2>This is an H2</h2><p>It feels like a lot of people just get to come along with me and live that dream. I&#x27;m also just excited for the somewhat communal nature of live music, and what live music can do for an audience who comes together to witness it.&quot; he continues.</p><p></p><h3>This is an H3</h3><p>It feels like a lot of people just get to come along with me and live that dream. I&#x27;m also just excited for the somewhat communal nature of live music, and what live music can do for an audience who comes together to witness it.&quot; he continues.</p><p></p><h4>This is an H4</h4><p>It feels like a lot of people just get to come along with me and live that dream. I&#x27;m also just excited for the somewhat communal nature of live music, and what live music can do for an audience who comes together to witness it.&quot; he continues.</p><p></p><h5>This is an H5</h5><p>It feels like a lot of people just get to come along with me and live that dream. I&#x27;m also just excited for the somewhat communal nature of live music, and what live music can do for an audience who comes together to witness it.&quot; he continues.</p><p></p><h6>This is an H6</h6><p>It feels like a lot of people just get to come along with me and live that dream. I&#x27;m also just excited for the somewhat communal nature of live music, and what live music can do for an audience who comes together to witness it.&quot; he continues.</p>",
